    {
      "slug": "services",
      "page_level_design_instruction": "The Services page follows a classic stacked landing layout rendered through the Bento Modular aesthetic \u2014 every section is composed of rounded, card-like modules with clear internal padding, consistent corner radii (16\u201324px), and deliberate whitespace between each vertical block. The page background is Clearmind Cloud (#F5F7FA) throughout, establishing an airy, clinical-calm canvas. Individual sections alternate between Cloud and White (#FFFFFF) surface treatments to create gentle visual rhythm without hard dividers. The single bright accent \u2014 Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C) \u2014 is reserved exclusively for CTAs, active highlights, icon fills, and key interactive states. Clearmind Mist (#E8EEF4) fills secondary card surfaces and comparison panels. Clearmind Dew (#D6F0E8) is used for stat or feature tile tints and the CTA section's background wash. Clearmind Slate (#1A2332) anchors all primary headings and navigation. Clearmind Stone (#6B7A8F) handles all supporting copy, captions, metadata labels, and eyebrow tags.\n\nTypography follows the shared system strictly: Manrope 700\u2013800 at tight letter-spacing for all H1\u2013H3 headings; Source Sans 3 400 at 1.65\u20131.75 line-height for body and description copy; DM Sans 500 in small uppercase with 0.10em letter-spacing for all eyebrow labels, metadata tags, and category lines. The modular scale steps down cleanly \u2014 the page header uses the largest display size, section headlines use H2, card titles use H3, and metadata/eyebrow lines use the DM Sans accent treatment.\n\nSection rhythm: The page opens with a compact, centered page header (section 1), followed by the densest and most visually complex section \u2014 the six-card service grid (section 2). Section 3 is a focused two-column comparison panel with a lighter surface. Section 4 is a full-width FAQ accordion-style module. Section 5 is the closing CTA band with a Dew-tinted background and illustration. Vertical spacing between sections is generous (80\u2013100px on desktop, 48\u201364px on mobile) to let each bento cluster breathe. All sections are horizontally constrained to a max-width of 1200px, centered, with 24px horizontal padding on mobile and 48px on tablet.\n\nResponsive behavior: On desktop, the service grid is a 3-column asymmetric bento layout. On tablet it collapses to 2 columns. On mobile it becomes a single-column stacked list. The comparison section is 2 columns on desktop/tablet and stacks vertically on mobile. The FAQ accordion is always full-width. The CTA section is centered single-column on all breakpoints. All bento cards maintain their rounded corners and internal padding at every breakpoint \u2014 the modular identity is preserved across screen sizes. Interactive states (hover on cards, focus on FAQ items) use a subtle Sage border or shadow lift to signal interactivity without disrupting the calm palette. No decorative gradients are used \u2014 all depth is achieved through surface color contrast, box shadows (soft, low-opacity Slate), and whitespace.",
      "section_design_plans": [
        {
          "id": "services-section-1",
          "nl_prompt": "Design a compact, centered page header section for the Services page. The section sits at the very top of the content area, directly below the site navigation, on a Clearmind Cloud (#F5F7FA) background. There is no full-bleed hero image \u2014 instead, the content is typographically driven and intentionally restrained, signaling clarity and calm. Vertical padding is 72px top, 56px bottom on desktop; 48px top, 40px bottom on mobile.\n\nLayout: All content is horizontally centered, max-width 680px, within the 1200px page container.\n\nEyebrow: 'What We Offer' rendered in DM Sans 500, uppercase, 0.10em letter-spacing, 12px font size, Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C) color. Positioned above the headline with 0 bottom margin before a 12px gap to the headline.\n\nHeadline: 'Therapy shaped around you.' in Manrope 800, ~52px on desktop / 36px on mobile, Clearmind Slate (#1A2332), letter-spacing -0.03em. This is the largest typographic moment on the page \u2014 it should feel grounded and personal, not clinical.\n\nSubheadline: 'Whether you're navigating anxiety, relationship strain, or a major life change, we have a path forward designed for your situation.' in Source Sans 3 400, 19px on desktop / 17px on mobile, Clearmind Stone (#6B7A8F), line-height 1.7, max-width 580px centered. Sits 20px below the headline.\n\nNo CTAs, no images, no cards in this section. The section serves purely as a reassuring orienting moment. A subtle 1px Clearmind Mist (#E8EEF4) horizontal rule below the section separates it from the service grid \u2014 do not use a hard divider, just a faint line or 8px section gap accent."
        },
        {
          "id": "services-section-2",
          "nl_prompt": "Design the primary service grid section \u2014 the most visually complex and information-dense section on the page. This is the heart of the Services page and must embody the Bento Modular aesthetic at its fullest. The section background is Clearmind White (#FFFFFF), with 80px vertical padding on desktop and 56px on mobile.\n\nSection header (centered, max-width 720px, centered in the 1200px container):\n- Eyebrow: 'Our Services' in DM Sans 500, uppercase, 0.10em letter-spacing, 12px, Clearmind Stone (#6B7A8F).\n- Headline: 'Find the support that fits your life.' in Manrope 700, 40px desktop / 28px mobile, Clearmind Slate (#1A2332), letter-spacing -0.02em.\n- 32px gap below the headline before the card grid begins.\n\nCard Grid Layout: Six service cards arranged in an asymmetric 3-column bento grid on desktop. The top row contains three equal-width cards. The bottom row also contains three equal-width cards. Each card is a rounded rectangle (20px border-radius), background Clearmind Mist (#E8EEF4), with 28px internal padding. Cards have a soft box-shadow (0 2px 12px rgba(26,35,50,0.07)) and on hover elevate slightly (0 6px 24px rgba(26,35,50,0.12)) with a 1.5px Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C) border appearing \u2014 this signals interactivity.\n\nEach card contains, from top to bottom:\n1. Icon: A minimal line icon (from the six-icon set described in the asset ideas \u2014 single person, two interlinked figures, family group, teen silhouette, video screen, medical clipboard respectively). Icon is 32\u00d732px, Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C) stroke color, placed in the top-left of the card. Do not center the icon \u2014 left-align it for a dashboard-widget feel.\n2. Service title: Manrope 700, 20px, Clearmind Slate (#1A2332), 12px below the icon.\n3. Description: Source Sans 3 400, 15px, Clearmind Stone (#6B7A8F), line-height 1.65, 10px below the title.\n4. Metadata row: Two small pill-shaped tags at the bottom of the card \u2014 one for session length, one for format. Each pill: DM Sans 500, 11px, uppercase, 0.08em letter-spacing, Clearmind Dew (#D6F0E8) background, Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C) text, 4px vertical / 10px horizontal padding, 20px border-radius. The pills sit 16px below the description, flush to the bottom of the card.\n\nOn tablet: 2-column grid, cards reflow naturally, maintaining equal widths.\nOn mobile: Single-column stacked list, full-width cards.\n\nBelow the card grid, centered, 40px below the last card row: A single primary CTA button \u2014 'Book a Consultation' \u2014 in Manrope 700, 16px, Clearmind White (#FFFFFF) text on Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C) background, 14px vertical / 32px horizontal padding, 10px border-radius. On hover: background darkens 10% toward #3A9E7C. The button is the only Sage-filled element in this section, making it visually dominant as the action anchor."
        },
        {
          "id": "services-section-3",
          "nl_prompt": "Design a focused two-panel comparison section helping visitors choose between in-person and telehealth therapy. The section background is Clearmind Cloud (#F5F7FA), 72px vertical padding on desktop, 48px on mobile. This section should feel calm and informative \u2014 not a hard sales push, but a helpful decision tool.\n\nSection header (centered, max-width 640px):\n- Eyebrow: 'In-Person vs. Telehealth' in DM Sans 500, uppercase, 0.10em letter-spacing, 12px, Clearmind Stone (#6B7A8F).\n- Headline: 'Both paths lead to real progress.' in Manrope 700, 36px desktop / 26px mobile, Clearmind Slate (#1A2332), letter-spacing -0.02em.\n- Subheadline: 'Here's how to decide what works best for you.' in Source Sans 3 400, 18px, Clearmind Stone (#6B7A8F), line-height 1.7. 16px below headline.\n- 40px gap below subheadline before the comparison panels.\n\nComparison panels: Two side-by-side bento cards on desktop (equal width, 24px gap between), stacking vertically on mobile. Each panel is a rounded rectangle (20px border-radius), 32px internal padding.\n\nLeft panel \u2014 'In-Person Therapy': Background Clearmind White (#FFFFFF). A subtle left-border accent: 3px solid Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C). Title in Manrope 700, 22px, Clearmind Slate (#1A2332). Description in Source Sans 3 400, 16px, Clearmind Stone (#6B7A8F), line-height 1.7, 12px below title. Metadata block at the bottom of the card: two rows, each with a DM Sans 500 uppercase label (12px, Clearmind Stone) and a value in Source Sans 3 400, 15px, Clearmind Slate. Label: 'Availability' / Value: 'Mon\u2013Sat'. Label: 'Location' / Value: 'Our downtown office suite'. Metadata sits 20px below the description, separated by a 1px Clearmind Mist (#E8EEF4) horizontal rule.\n\nRight panel \u2014 'Telehealth Therapy': Background Clearmind Dew (#D6F0E8). Same typographic structure as the left panel. The Dew background differentiates the telehealth option as a warm, accessible alternative without implying it is lesser. Same left-border accent in Sage. Same metadata structure: 'Availability' / 'Mon\u2013Sun', 'Location' / 'Anywhere with a secure connection'.\n\nNo CTAs in this section. The section ends with 72px bottom padding before transitioning to the FAQ section. On desktop, both panels are equal in height (CSS grid stretch), so they always align vertically regardless of content length."
        },
        {
          "id": "services-section-4",

input.content:
/* ==========================================================================
   Clearmind Therapy — Design System
   ========================================================================== */

:root {
  --slate: #1A2332;
  --cloud: #F5F7FA;
  --sage: #4AAE8C;
  --sage-deep: #3A9478;
  --mist: #E8EEF4;
  --stone: #6B7A8F;
  --dew: #D6F0E8;
  --white: #FFFFFF;
  --coral: #E8715A;
  --coral-tint: #FAE8E5;
  --stone-on-dark: #B8C3D0;

  --font-heading: 'Manrope', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  --font-body: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  --font-accent: 'DM Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;

  --shadow-sm: 0 2px 12px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.06);
  --shadow-md: 0 2px 16px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.07);
  --shadow-lg: 0 4px 24px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.08);
  --shadow-hover: 0 6px 24px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.12);

  --radius-sm: 8px;
  --radius-md: 12px;
  --radius-lg: 16px;
  --radius-xl: 20px;
  --radius-2xl: 24px;

  --container: 1200px;
  --container-narrow: 1120px;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Reset & base
   ========================================================================== */
*,
*::before,
*::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--slate);
  background-color: var(--cloud);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
}

h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 0;
}

p { margin: 0; }

a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

button {
  font-family: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
  border: none;
  background: none;
}

img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }

ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }

/* ==========================================================================
   Layout helpers
   ========================================================================== */
.container {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: var(--container);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 24px;
}

.container--narrow { max-width: var(--container-narrow); }

.section { padding: 100px 0; }
.section--compact { padding: 80px 0; }
.section--header { padding: 96px 0 72px; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .section { padding: 64px 0; }
  .section--compact { padding: 56px 0; }
  .section--header { padding: 64px 0 48px; }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .section { padding: 48px 0; }
  .section--compact { padding: 40px 0; }
  .section--header { padding: 48px 0 32px; }
  .container { padding: 0 20px; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Typography
   ========================================================================== */
.eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  color: var(--sage);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.eyebrow--stone { color: var(--stone); }

.headline-display {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  line-height: 1.1;
  color: var(--slate);
}

.headline-page {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 52px);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  line-height: 1.15;
  color: var(--slate);
}

.headline-section {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 44px);
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  line-height: 1.15;
}

.headline-medium {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.subheadline {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 16px;
}

.section-header { margin-bottom: 40px; }
.section-header--center { text-align: center; }
.section-header--center .subheadline { max-width: 580px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

/* ==========================================================================
   Buttons
   ========================================================================== */
.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 15px;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  padding: 14px 28px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease, color 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.btn-primary {
  background: var(--sage);
  color: var(--white);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}
.btn-primary:hover {
  background: var(--sage-deep);
  border-color: var(--sage-deep);
}

.btn-secondary {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--slate);
  border-color: var(--slate);
}
.btn-secondary:hover { background: var(--mist); }

.btn-on-dark-secondary {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--white);
  border-color: var(--white);
}
.btn-on-dark-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); }

.btn-outline-sage {
  background: var(--white);
  color: var(--sage);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}
.btn-outline-sage:hover {
  background: var(--sage);
  color: var(--white);
}

.btn-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 32px;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .btn { width: 100%; }
  .btn-row { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
}

.text-link {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--sage);
  border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  padding-bottom: 2px;
  transition: color 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
}
.text-link:hover {
  color: var(--slate);
  border-bottom-color: currentColor;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Navigation
   ========================================================================== */
.site-nav {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 50;
  background: var(--slate);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
}

.site-nav__inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  height: 72px;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: var(--container);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 24px;
}

.brand {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 18px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--white);
}

.brand__mark {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 32px;
}

.nav-links a {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone-on-dark);
  transition: color 200ms ease;
  position: relative;
  padding: 6px 0;
}

.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--white); }

.nav-links a.is-active {
  color: var(--white);
}
.nav-links a.is-active::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: -4px;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--sage);
  border-radius: 2px;
}

.nav-cta {
  background: var(--sage);
  color: var(--white);
  padding: 10px 18px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease;
}
.nav-cta:hover { background: var(--sage-deep); }

.nav-toggle {
  display: none;
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--white);
}
.nav-toggle svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0 auto; }

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .nav-links {
    position: absolute;
    top: 72px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    background: var(--slate);
    padding: 16px 24px 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    display: none;
  }
  .nav-links.is-open { display: flex; }
  .nav-links a { padding: 12px 0; width: 100%; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
  .nav-links a.is-active::after { display: none; }
  .nav-toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .nav-cta { display: none; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Footer
   ========================================================================== */
.site-footer {
  background: var(--slate);
  color: var(--stone-on-dark);
  padding: 64px 0 40px;
}

.footer-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
}

.footer-col h4 {
  color: var(--white);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.footer-col p {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.footer-col li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
.footer-col li a {
  color: var(--stone-on-dark);
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: color 200ms ease;
}
.footer-col li a:hover { color: var(--white); }

.footer-bottom {
  margin-top: 48px;
  padding-top: 24px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  font-size: 13px;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Hero (home)
   ========================================================================== */
.hero {
  background: var(--cloud);
  padding: 80px 0 100px;
}

.hero__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 55% 45%;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 48px;
}

.hero__copy .headline-display { margin-top: 0; }
.hero__copy .subheadline { margin-top: 20px; max-width: 480px; }

.hero__visual {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(26,35,50,0.07);
  padding: 28px;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 3.6;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.hero__visual svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .hero__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .hero__visual { max-height: 400px; aspect-ratio: 16/10; }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .hero { padding: 56px 0 64px; }
  .hero__visual { padding: 16px; aspect-ratio: 16/9; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Stats section
   ========================================================================== */
.stats {
  background: var(--mist);
}

.stats-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.stat-tile {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  min-height: 140px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
}

.stat-tile--accent { background: var(--dew); }

.stat-tile__value {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(32px, 3.5vw, 44px);
  color: var(--sage);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1;
}

.stat-tile__label {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 12px;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .stat-tile { padding: 24px; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Feature grid (home)
   ========================================================================== */
.feature-bento {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 58% 42%;
  grid-template-rows: auto auto;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.feature-bento .tile { padding: 32px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); position: relative; }
.feature-bento .tile h3 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.feature-bento .tile p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--stone); line-height: 1.7; }

.feature-bento .tile--white { background: var(--white); }
.feature-bento .tile--dew { background: var(--dew); }
.feature-bento .tile--mist { background: var(--mist); }

.feature-bento .tile--dark {
  background: var(--slate);
  grid-row: span 2;
  color: var(--white);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.feature-bento .tile--dark h3 { color: var(--white); }
.feature-bento .tile--dark p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); }

.tile--dark .deco-shape {
  position: absolute;
  right: -80px;
  bottom: -80px;
  width: 320px;
  height: 320px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--sage);
  opacity: 0.14;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.tile-icon {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: 10px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--sage);
}

.tile--dark .tile-icon { background: rgba(74,174,140,0.18); color: var(--sage); }

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .feature-bento { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .feature-bento .tile--dark { grid-row: auto; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Testimonials
   ========================================================================== */
.testimonials-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.testimonial {
  position: relative;
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 36px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  min-height: 260px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.testimonial--accent { background: var(--dew); box-shadow: none; }

.testimonial__quote-mark {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 56px;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--sage);
  opacity: 0.32;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.testimonial__title {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.testimonial__body {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.7;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.testimonial__attribution {
  margin-top: 24px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
}

.testimonial__dot {
  position: absolute;
  top: 20px;
  right: 20px;
  width: 10px;
  height: 10px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--coral);
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Closing CTA — slate
   ========================================================================== */
.cta-slate {
  background: var(--slate);
  color: var(--white);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.cta-slate__pattern {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0.55;
}

.cta-slate__inner {
  position: relative;
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.cta-slate h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: var(--white);
}

.cta-slate p.subheadline {
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  max-width: 480px;
  margin: 20px auto 0;
}

.cta-slate .btn-row {
  justify-content: center;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Page header (services / practitioners / resources / contact)
   ========================================================================== */
.page-header {
  background: var(--cloud);
}
.page-header--mist { background: var(--mist); }

.page-header__inner {
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.page-header__inner .subheadline { max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

.page-header__rule {
  width: 48px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--mist);
  margin: 0 auto 20px;
}

.page-header__split {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 40px;
}

.deco-cluster {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 12px;
  width: 220px;
}
.deco-cluster span {
  display: block;
  height: 56px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: var(--dew);
}
.deco-cluster span:nth-child(1) { background: var(--white); transform: rotate(-3deg); }
.deco-cluster span:nth-child(2) { transform: rotate(4deg); }
.deco-cluster span:nth-child(3) { transform: rotate(2deg); height: 70px; }
.deco-cluster span:nth-child(4) { background: var(--white); transform: rotate(-5deg); height: 64px; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .deco-cluster { display: none; }
  .page-header__split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Services — item grid
   ========================================================================== */
.services-section {
  background: var(--white);
}

.service-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.service-card {
  background: var(--mist);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  transition: box-shadow 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.service-card:hover {
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
  border-color: var(--sage);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.service-card__icon {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--sage);
}
.service-card__icon svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

.service-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 20px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.service-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.pill-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.pill {
  background: var(--dew);
  color: var(--sage);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 20px;
}

.service-grid + .center-cta { text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Comparison panels
   ========================================================================== */
.comparison-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
  margin-top: 40px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.compare-panel {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 32px;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.compare-panel--accent { background: var(--dew); }

.compare-panel h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.compare-panel p {
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.compare-meta {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--mist);
  padding-top: 16px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
}
.compare-panel--accent .compare-meta { border-top-color: rgba(26,35,50,0.06); }

.compare-meta__row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr;
  gap: 12px;
  align-items: center;
}
.compare-meta__label {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
}
.compare-meta__value {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .comparison-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   FAQ
   ========================================================================== */
.faq-section {
  background: var(--white);
}

.faq-list {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin-top: 36px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}
.faq-list--center { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

.faq-item {
  background: var(--cloud);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 20px 24px;
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
}

.faq-item[open] {
  background: var(--white);
  border-color: var(--sage);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
}

.faq-item summary {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 17px;
  color: var(--slate);
  list-style: none;
}
.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }

.faq-chevron {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  color: var(--stone);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  transition: transform 200ms ease, color 200ms ease;
}
.faq-item[open] .faq-chevron {
  transform: rotate(180deg);
  color: var(--sage);
}

.faq-answer {
  margin-top: 12px;
  padding-top: 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.7;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--mist);
}

/* CTA-tinted FAQ (Contact page variant) */
.faq-list--cards .faq-item {
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid var(--mist);
  border-radius: 12px;
}
.faq-list--cards .faq-item[open] {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}
.faq-list--cards .faq-item summary { font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; }
.faq-list--cards .faq-chevron::before {
  content: "+";
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--sage);
  display: block;
  line-height: 1;
}
.faq-list--cards .faq-chevron { background: none; }
.faq-list--cards .faq-chevron svg { display: none; }
.faq-list--cards .faq-item[open] .faq-chevron::before { content: "×"; }
.faq-list--cards .faq-answer { border-top: 1px solid rgba(26,35,50,0.06); }

/* ==========================================================================
   Closing CTA — Dew
   ========================================================================== */
.cta-dew {
  background: var(--dew);
  padding: 96px 0;
}

.cta-dew__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 60% 40%;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 48px;
}

.cta-dew__copy h2 { color: var(--slate); max-width: 480px; }
.cta-dew__copy .subheadline { max-width: 420px; }

.cta-dew__visual { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; }
.cta-dew__visual svg { max-width: 340px; width: 100%; height: auto; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .cta-dew__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .cta-dew__visual { display: none; }
  .cta-dew { padding: 64px 0; }
}

/* CTA — gradient */
.cta-gradient {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--dew) 0%, var(--cloud) 100%);
  text-align: center;
}

.cta-gradient .reassure-row {
  margin-top: 28px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Practitioners grid
   ========================================================================== */
.practitioner-section { background: var(--cloud); }

.practitioner-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

/* asymmetric desktop layout (per design plan) */
.practitioner-grid > .practitioner-card:nth-child(1) { grid-column: span 2; }
.practitioner-grid > .practitioner-card:nth-child(6) { grid-column: span 2; }

.practitioner-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.practitioner-card__head {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.avatar-tile {
  width: 80px;
  height: 80px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  background: var(--dew);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.avatar-tile svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

.practitioner-card__name {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.practitioner-card__specialty {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  color: var(--sage);
}

.practitioner-card__desc {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.practitioner-card__divider {
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--mist);
  margin: 16px 0 12px;
}

.meta-pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
.meta-pill {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  padding: 6px 10px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: var(--mist);
  color: var(--stone);
}
.meta-pill--accept { background: var(--dew); color: var(--sage); }
.meta-pill--limited { background: var(--coral-tint); color: var(--coral); }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .practitioner-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .practitioner-grid > .practitioner-card:nth-child(1),
  .practitioner-grid > .practitioner-card:nth-child(6) { grid-column: auto; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .practitioner-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Story block (practitioners — slate)
   ========================================================================== */
.story-slate {
  background: var(--slate);
  color: var(--white);
}

.story-slate__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 60% 40%;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: center;
}

.story-slate h2 { color: var(--white); }
.story-slate p {
  margin-top: 24px;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--stone-on-dark);
  max-width: 60ch;
}

.story-slate__visual {
  position: relative;
  height: 340px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: rgba(232,238,244,0.06);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 32px;
}
.story-slate__visual::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 16px;
  right: 16px;
  width: 100px;
  height: 100px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: rgba(214,240,232,0.18);
}
.story-slate__visual::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 16px;
  left: 16px;
  width: 80px;
  height: 80px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: rgba(74,174,140,0.18);
}
.story-pull-quote {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  text-align: center;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--white);
  line-height: 1.3;
  max-width: 220px;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .story-slate__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .story-slate__visual { display: none; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Story block — mist (resources)
   ========================================================================== */
.story-mist {
  background: var(--mist);
}

.story-mist__inner {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.story-mist__body {
  position: relative;
  padding-left: 24px;
  margin-top: 20px;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--stone);
}
.story-mist__body::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 6px;
  width: 3px;
  height: 60px;
  background: var(--sage);
  border-radius: 2px;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .story-mist__body { padding-left: 0; padding-top: 16px; }
  .story-mist__body::before { left: 0; top: 0; width: 60px; height: 3px; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Practitioners stats + chart
   ========================================================================== */
.expertise-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr) 280px;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 40px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.expertise-grid .stat-tile { background: var(--white); }

.expertise-grid .stat-tile__value {
  color: var(--slate);
  font-size: 44px;
}

.chart-tile {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 24px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 12px;
}
.chart-tile h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  color: var(--stone);
}

@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .expertise-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
  .chart-tile { grid-column: span 2; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .expertise-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .chart-tile { grid-column: span 2; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Resources — article list
   ========================================================================== */
.articles-section { background: var(--cloud); }

.article-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  grid-auto-rows: minmax(260px, auto);
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.article-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 24px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;
  border-left: 3px solid transparent;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.article-card:hover {
  background: var(--mist);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
  border-left-color: var(--sage);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.article-card--hero {
  grid-column: span 2;
  grid-row: span 2;
  padding: 32px;
}

.article-card--hero::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 4px;
  background: var(--sage);
}

.article-card__category {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--dew);
  color: var(--sage);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.article-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 17px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  color: var(--slate);
}

.article-card--hero h3 {
  font-size: 26px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.article-card p {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  flex-grow: 1;
}
.article-card--hero p { font-size: 15px; }

.article-card__meta {
  margin-top: 20px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--stone);
}

.article-card__meta svg {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  color: var(--sage);
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .article-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .article-card--hero { grid-column: span 2; grid-row: auto; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .article-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .article-card--hero { grid-column: auto; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Resources — feature library grid
   ========================================================================== */
.library-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.library-tile {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: 28px;
  padding: 32px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-height: 240px;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
}
.library-tile:hover {
  background: var(--mist);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(26,35,50,0.10);
}

.library-tile--alert {
  background: var(--white);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--coral);
}
.library-tile--alert:hover { background: #FDF2F0; }
.library-tile--alert .library-tile__icon { color: var(--coral); }

.library-tile__icon {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  color: var(--sage);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.library-tile h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 20px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.library-tile p {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.library-tile__link {
  margin-top: 16px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--sage);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .library-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Contact form
   ========================================================================== */
.contact-form-section { background: var(--white); padding: 80px 0; }

.contact-form-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 60% 40%;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: start;
}

.contact-form .eyebrow { color: var(--stone); }
.contact-form h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 30px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-top: 8px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.contact-form > p {
  margin-top: 16px;
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
}

.field-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 28px;
}
.field-grid .field--full { grid-column: span 2; }

.field {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
}

.field label {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
}
.field label .required-dot {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  background: var(--sage);
  border-radius: 50%;
  margin-left: 6px;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
.field label .field-hint {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 13px;
  text-transform: none;
  letter-spacing: normal;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 4px;
}

.field input,
.field select,
.field textarea {
  width: 100%;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
  border: 1px solid var(--mist);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  background: var(--white);
  transition: border-color 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
}
.field textarea { min-height: 120px; resize: vertical; }
.field select { appearance: none; background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='%236B7A8F' stroke-width='2'><polyline points='6 9 12 15 18 9'/></svg>"); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: right 14px center; background-size: 16px; padding-right: 40px; }

.field input::placeholder,
.field textarea::placeholder { color: var(--stone); opacity: 0.6; }

.field input:focus,
.field select:focus,
.field textarea:focus {
  outline: none;
  border-color: var(--sage);
  border-width: 2px;
  padding: 11px 13px;
}
.field textarea:focus { padding: 11px 13px; }

.contact-form .btn-primary {
  width: 100%;
  margin-top: 24px;
  height: 52px;
  border-radius: 8px;
}

/* Reassurance card */
.reassure-card {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);
}

.reassure-card__intro {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.reassure-card__intro svg {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  color: var(--sage);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  margin-top: 4px;
}
.reassure-card__intro p {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.trust-list {
  margin-top: 20px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}
.trust-list li {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.5;
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.trust-list svg {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  color: var(--sage);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.callback-line {
  margin-top: 20px;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
}
.callback-line .number { color: var(--sage); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .contact-form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .field-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .field-grid .field--full { grid-column: auto; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Map block
   ========================================================================== */
.map-section { background: var(--mist); }

.map-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 55% 45%;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.map-tile {
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(26,35,50,0.08);
  border: 1px solid var(--mist);
  background: var(--white);
  aspect-ratio: 4/3;
}
.map-tile svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }

.map-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
.map-info .body-copy {
  margin-top: 20px;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.map-info .body-copy strong { font-weight: 600; }

.map-info-list {
  margin-top: 24px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}
.map-info-list li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.map-info-list svg {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  color: var(--sage);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .map-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Contact channels (feature_grid)
   ========================================================================== */
.contact-channels { background: var(--white); padding: 72px 0; }

.contact-channels__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 32px;
}

.channel-card {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 28px 24px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease;
}
.channel-card:hover { background: #C7E7DD; }

.channel-card__icon {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  color: var(--sage);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.channel-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 16px;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.channel-card p {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
}
.channel-card .accent { color: var(--sage); font-weight: 600; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .contact-channels__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .contact-channels__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Contact FAQ split
   ========================================================================== */
.contact-faq { background: var(--cloud); }

.contact-faq__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 55% 45%;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: start;
}

.contact-faq__list { order: 1; }
.contact-faq__sidebar { order: 2; }

.contact-faq__sidebar h2 {
  margin-top: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 28px;
  color: var(--slate);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.contact-illo-tile {
  background: var(--mist);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 24px;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 320px;
  margin: 28px 0 24px;
  aspect-ratio: 4/3;
}
.contact-illo-tile svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

.contact-faq__footer-line {
  margin-top: 40px;
  text-align: center;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
}
.contact-faq__footer-line .number { color: var(--sage); font-style: normal; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .contact-faq__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .contact-faq__sidebar { order: 1; }
  .contact-faq__list { order: 2; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Helpers
   ========================================================================== */
.text-left { text-align: left; }
.text-center { text-align: center; }
.mt-32 { margin-top: 32px; }
.mt-40 { margin-top: 40px; }

.center-cta {
  margin-top: 40px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
}

tool_use_result.content:
/* ==========================================================================
   Clearmind Therapy — Design System
   ========================================================================== */

:root {
  --slate: #1A2332;
  --cloud: #F5F7FA;
  --sage: #4AAE8C;
  --sage-deep: #3A9478;
  --mist: #E8EEF4;
  --stone: #6B7A8F;
  --dew: #D6F0E8;
  --white: #FFFFFF;
  --coral: #E8715A;
  --coral-tint: #FAE8E5;
  --stone-on-dark: #B8C3D0;

  --font-heading: 'Manrope', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  --font-body: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  --font-accent: 'DM Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;

  --shadow-sm: 0 2px 12px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.06);
  --shadow-md: 0 2px 16px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.07);
  --shadow-lg: 0 4px 24px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.08);
  --shadow-hover: 0 6px 24px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.12);

  --radius-sm: 8px;
  --radius-md: 12px;
  --radius-lg: 16px;
  --radius-xl: 20px;
  --radius-2xl: 24px;

  --container: 1200px;
  --container-narrow: 1120px;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Reset & base
   ========================================================================== */
*,
*::before,
*::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--slate);
  background-color: var(--cloud);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
}

h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 0;
}

p { margin: 0; }

a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

button {
  font-family: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
  border: none;
  background: none;
}

img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }

ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }

/* ==========================================================================
   Layout helpers
   ========================================================================== */
.container {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: var(--container);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 24px;
}

.container--narrow { max-width: var(--container-narrow); }

.section { padding: 100px 0; }
.section--compact { padding: 80px 0; }
.section--header { padding: 96px 0 72px; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .section { padding: 64px 0; }
  .section--compact { padding: 56px 0; }
  .section--header { padding: 64px 0 48px; }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .section { padding: 48px 0; }
  .section--compact { padding: 40px 0; }
  .section--header { padding: 48px 0 32px; }
  .container { padding: 0 20px; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Typography
   ========================================================================== */
.eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  color: var(--sage);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.eyebrow--stone { color: var(--stone); }

.headline-display {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 60px);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  line-height: 1.1;
  color: var(--slate);
}

.headline-page {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 52px);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  line-height: 1.15;
  color: var(--slate);
}

.headline-section {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 44px);
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  line-height: 1.15;
}

.headline-medium {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.subheadline {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 16px;
}

.section-header { margin-bottom: 40px; }
.section-header--center { text-align: center; }
.section-header--center .subheadline { max-width: 580px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

/* ==========================================================================
   Buttons
   ========================================================================== */
.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 15px;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  padding: 14px 28px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease, color 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.btn-primary {
  background: var(--sage);
  color: var(--white);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}
.btn-primary:hover {
  background: var(--sage-deep);
  border-color: var(--sage-deep);
}

.btn-secondary {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--slate);
  border-color: var(--slate);
}
.btn-secondary:hover { background: var(--mist); }

.btn-on-dark-secondary {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--white);
  border-color: var(--white);
}
.btn-on-dark-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.10); }

.btn-outline-sage {
  background: var(--white);
  color: var(--sage);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}
.btn-outline-sage:hover {
  background: var(--sage);
  color: var(--white);
}

.btn-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 32px;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .btn { width: 100%; }
  .btn-row { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
}

.text-link {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--sage);
  border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  padding-bottom: 2px;
  transition: color 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
}
.text-link:hover {
  color: var(--slate);
  border-bottom-color: currentColor;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Navigation
   ========================================================================== */
.site-nav {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 50;
  background: var(--slate);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
}

.site-nav__inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  height: 72px;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: var(--container);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 24px;
}

.brand {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 18px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--white);
}

.brand__mark {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 32px;
}

.nav-links a {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone-on-dark);
  transition: color 200ms ease;
  position: relative;
  padding: 6px 0;
}

.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--white); }

.nav-links a.is-active {
  color: var(--white);
}
.nav-links a.is-active::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: -4px;
  height: 2px;
  background: var(--sage);
  border-radius: 2px;
}

.nav-cta {
  background: var(--sage);
  color: var(--white);
  padding: 10px 18px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease;
}
.nav-cta:hover { background: var(--sage-deep); }

.nav-toggle {
  display: none;
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--white);
}
.nav-toggle svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; margin: 0 auto; }

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .nav-links {
    position: absolute;
    top: 72px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    background: var(--slate);
    padding: 16px 24px 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    display: none;
  }
  .nav-links.is-open { display: flex; }
  .nav-links a { padding: 12px 0; width: 100%; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
  .nav-links a.is-active::after { display: none; }
  .nav-toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .nav-cta { display: none; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Footer
   ========================================================================== */
.site-footer {
  background: var(--slate);
  color: var(--stone-on-dark);
  padding: 64px 0 40px;
}

.footer-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
}

.footer-col h4 {
  color: var(--white);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.footer-col p {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.footer-col li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
.footer-col li a {
  color: var(--stone-on-dark);
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: color 200ms ease;
}
.footer-col li a:hover { color: var(--white); }

.footer-bottom {
  margin-top: 48px;
  padding-top: 24px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
  font-size: 13px;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Hero (home)
   ========================================================================== */
.hero {
  background: var(--cloud);
  padding: 80px 0 100px;
}

.hero__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 55% 45%;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 48px;
}

.hero__copy .headline-display { margin-top: 0; }
.hero__copy .subheadline { margin-top: 20px; max-width: 480px; }

.hero__visual {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(26,35,50,0.07);
  padding: 28px;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 3.6;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.hero__visual svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .hero__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .hero__visual { max-height: 400px; aspect-ratio: 16/10; }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .hero { padding: 56px 0 64px; }
  .hero__visual { padding: 16px; aspect-ratio: 16/9; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Stats section
   ========================================================================== */
.stats {
  background: var(--mist);
}

.stats-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.stat-tile {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  min-height: 140px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
}

.stat-tile--accent { background: var(--dew); }

.stat-tile__value {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(32px, 3.5vw, 44px);
  color: var(--sage);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1;
}

.stat-tile__label {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 12px;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .stat-tile { padding: 24px; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Feature grid (home)
   ========================================================================== */
.feature-bento {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 58% 42%;
  grid-template-rows: auto auto;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.feature-bento .tile { padding: 32px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); position: relative; }
.feature-bento .tile h3 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.feature-bento .tile p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--stone); line-height: 1.7; }

.feature-bento .tile--white { background: var(--white); }
.feature-bento .tile--dew { background: var(--dew); }
.feature-bento .tile--mist { background: var(--mist); }

.feature-bento .tile--dark {
  background: var(--slate);
  grid-row: span 2;
  color: var(--white);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.feature-bento .tile--dark h3 { color: var(--white); }
.feature-bento .tile--dark p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); }

.tile--dark .deco-shape {
  position: absolute;
  right: -80px;
  bottom: -80px;
  width: 320px;
  height: 320px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--sage);
  opacity: 0.14;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.tile-icon {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: 10px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--sage);
}

.tile--dark .tile-icon { background: rgba(74,174,140,0.18); color: var(--sage); }

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .feature-bento { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .feature-bento .tile--dark { grid-row: auto; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Testimonials
   ========================================================================== */
.testimonials-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.testimonial {
  position: relative;
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 36px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  min-height: 260px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.testimonial--accent { background: var(--dew); box-shadow: none; }

.testimonial__quote-mark {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 56px;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--sage);
  opacity: 0.32;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.testimonial__title {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.testimonial__body {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.7;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.testimonial__attribution {
  margin-top: 24px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
}

.testimonial__dot {
  position: absolute;
  top: 20px;
  right: 20px;
  width: 10px;
  height: 10px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--coral);
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Closing CTA — slate
   ========================================================================== */
.cta-slate {
  background: var(--slate);
  color: var(--white);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.cta-slate__pattern {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  opacity: 0.55;
}

.cta-slate__inner {
  position: relative;
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.cta-slate h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1.2;
  color: var(--white);
}

.cta-slate p.subheadline {
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  max-width: 480px;
  margin: 20px auto 0;
}

.cta-slate .btn-row {
  justify-content: center;
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Page header (services / practitioners / resources / contact)
   ========================================================================== */
.page-header {
  background: var(--cloud);
}
.page-header--mist { background: var(--mist); }

.page-header__inner {
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.page-header__inner .subheadline { max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

.page-header__rule {
  width: 48px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--mist);
  margin: 0 auto 20px;
}

.page-header__split {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 40px;
}

.deco-cluster {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 12px;
  width: 220px;
}
.deco-cluster span {
  display: block;
  height: 56px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: var(--dew);
}
.deco-cluster span:nth-child(1) { background: var(--white); transform: rotate(-3deg); }
.deco-cluster span:nth-child(2) { transform: rotate(4deg); }
.deco-cluster span:nth-child(3) { transform: rotate(2deg); height: 70px; }
.deco-cluster span:nth-child(4) { background: var(--white); transform: rotate(-5deg); height: 64px; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .deco-cluster { display: none; }
  .page-header__split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; text-align: center; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Services — item grid
   ========================================================================== */
.services-section {
  background: var(--white);
}

.service-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.service-card {
  background: var(--mist);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  transition: box-shadow 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.service-card:hover {
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
  border-color: var(--sage);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.service-card__icon {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--sage);
}
.service-card__icon svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

.service-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 20px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.service-card p {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.pill-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.pill {
  background: var(--dew);
  color: var(--sage);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 20px;
}

.service-grid + .center-cta { text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Comparison panels
   ========================================================================== */
.comparison-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
  margin-top: 40px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.compare-panel {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 32px;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.compare-panel--accent { background: var(--dew); }

.compare-panel h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.compare-panel p {
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.compare-meta {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--mist);
  padding-top: 16px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
}
.compare-panel--accent .compare-meta { border-top-color: rgba(26,35,50,0.06); }

.compare-meta__row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr;
  gap: 12px;
  align-items: center;
}
.compare-meta__label {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
}
.compare-meta__value {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .comparison-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   FAQ
   ========================================================================== */
.faq-section {
  background: var(--white);
}

.faq-list {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin-top: 36px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}
.faq-list--center { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

.faq-item {
  background: var(--cloud);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 20px 24px;
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
}

.faq-item[open] {
  background: var(--white);
  border-color: var(--sage);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
}

.faq-item summary {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 17px;
  color: var(--slate);
  list-style: none;
}
.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }

.faq-chevron {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  color: var(--stone);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  transition: transform 200ms ease, color 200ms ease;
}
.faq-item[open] .faq-chevron {
  transform: rotate(180deg);
  color: var(--sage);
}

.faq-answer {
  margin-top: 12px;
  padding-top: 12px;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.7;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--mist);
}

/* CTA-tinted FAQ (Contact page variant) */
.faq-list--cards .faq-item {
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid var(--mist);
  border-radius: 12px;
}
.faq-list--cards .faq-item[open] {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}
.faq-list--cards .faq-item summary { font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; }
.faq-list--cards .faq-chevron::before {
  content: "+";
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--sage);
  display: block;
  line-height: 1;
}
.faq-list--cards .faq-chevron { background: none; }
.faq-list--cards .faq-chevron svg { display: none; }
.faq-list--cards .faq-item[open] .faq-chevron::before { content: "×"; }
.faq-list--cards .faq-answer { border-top: 1px solid rgba(26,35,50,0.06); }

/* ==========================================================================
   Closing CTA — Dew
   ========================================================================== */
.cta-dew {
  background: var(--dew);
  padding: 96px 0;
}

.cta-dew__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 60% 40%;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 48px;
}

.cta-dew__copy h2 { color: var(--slate); max-width: 480px; }
.cta-dew__copy .subheadline { max-width: 420px; }

.cta-dew__visual { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; }
.cta-dew__visual svg { max-width: 340px; width: 100%; height: auto; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .cta-dew__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .cta-dew__visual { display: none; }
  .cta-dew { padding: 64px 0; }
}

/* CTA — gradient */
.cta-gradient {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--dew) 0%, var(--cloud) 100%);
  text-align: center;
}

.cta-gradient .reassure-row {
  margin-top: 28px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Practitioners grid
   ========================================================================== */
.practitioner-section { background: var(--cloud); }

.practitioner-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

/* asymmetric desktop layout (per design plan) */
.practitioner-grid > .practitioner-card:nth-child(1) { grid-column: span 2; }
.practitioner-grid > .practitioner-card:nth-child(6) { grid-column: span 2; }

.practitioner-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.practitioner-card__head {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.avatar-tile {
  width: 80px;
  height: 80px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  background: var(--dew);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  overflow: hidden;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.avatar-tile svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

.practitioner-card__name {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.practitioner-card__specialty {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  color: var(--sage);
}

.practitioner-card__desc {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.practitioner-card__divider {
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--mist);
  margin: 16px 0 12px;
}

.meta-pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
.meta-pill {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  padding: 6px 10px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: var(--mist);
  color: var(--stone);
}
.meta-pill--accept { background: var(--dew); color: var(--sage); }
.meta-pill--limited { background: var(--coral-tint); color: var(--coral); }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .practitioner-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .practitioner-grid > .practitioner-card:nth-child(1),
  .practitioner-grid > .practitioner-card:nth-child(6) { grid-column: auto; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .practitioner-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Story block (practitioners — slate)
   ========================================================================== */
.story-slate {
  background: var(--slate);
  color: var(--white);
}

.story-slate__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 60% 40%;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: center;
}

.story-slate h2 { color: var(--white); }
.story-slate p {
  margin-top: 24px;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--stone-on-dark);
  max-width: 60ch;
}

.story-slate__visual {
  position: relative;
  height: 340px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  background: rgba(232,238,244,0.06);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 32px;
}
.story-slate__visual::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 16px;
  right: 16px;
  width: 100px;
  height: 100px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: rgba(214,240,232,0.18);
}
.story-slate__visual::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 16px;
  left: 16px;
  width: 80px;
  height: 80px;
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: rgba(74,174,140,0.18);
}
.story-pull-quote {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  text-align: center;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--white);
  line-height: 1.3;
  max-width: 220px;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .story-slate__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .story-slate__visual { display: none; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Story block — mist (resources)
   ========================================================================== */
.story-mist {
  background: var(--mist);
}

.story-mist__inner {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.story-mist__body {
  position: relative;
  padding-left: 24px;
  margin-top: 20px;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--stone);
}
.story-mist__body::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 6px;
  width: 3px;
  height: 60px;
  background: var(--sage);
  border-radius: 2px;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .story-mist__body { padding-left: 0; padding-top: 16px; }
  .story-mist__body::before { left: 0; top: 0; width: 60px; height: 3px; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Practitioners stats + chart
   ========================================================================== */
.expertise-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr) 280px;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 40px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.expertise-grid .stat-tile { background: var(--white); }

.expertise-grid .stat-tile__value {
  color: var(--slate);
  font-size: 44px;
}

.chart-tile {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 24px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 12px;
}
.chart-tile h4 {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  color: var(--stone);
}

@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .expertise-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
  .chart-tile { grid-column: span 2; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .expertise-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .chart-tile { grid-column: span 2; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Resources — article list
   ========================================================================== */
.articles-section { background: var(--cloud); }

.article-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  grid-auto-rows: minmax(260px, auto);
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.article-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 24px;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;
  border-left: 3px solid transparent;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.article-card:hover {
  background: var(--mist);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
  border-left-color: var(--sage);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.article-card--hero {
  grid-column: span 2;
  grid-row: span 2;
  padding: 32px;
}

.article-card--hero::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 4px;
  background: var(--sage);
}

.article-card__category {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--dew);
  color: var(--sage);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.article-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 17px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  color: var(--slate);
}

.article-card--hero h3 {
  font-size: 26px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.article-card p {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  flex-grow: 1;
}
.article-card--hero p { font-size: 15px; }

.article-card__meta {
  margin-top: 20px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--stone);
}

.article-card__meta svg {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  color: var(--sage);
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .article-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .article-card--hero { grid-column: span 2; grid-row: auto; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .article-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .article-card--hero { grid-column: auto; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Resources — feature library grid
   ========================================================================== */
.library-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

.library-tile {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: 28px;
  padding: 32px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-height: 240px;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
}
.library-tile:hover {
  background: var(--mist);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(26,35,50,0.10);
}

.library-tile--alert {
  background: var(--white);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--coral);
}
.library-tile--alert:hover { background: #FDF2F0; }
.library-tile--alert .library-tile__icon { color: var(--coral); }

.library-tile__icon {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  color: var(--sage);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.library-tile h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 20px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.library-tile p {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.library-tile__link {
  margin-top: 16px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--sage);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .library-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Contact form
   ========================================================================== */
.contact-form-section { background: var(--white); padding: 80px 0; }

.contact-form-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 60% 40%;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: start;
}

.contact-form .eyebrow { color: var(--stone); }
.contact-form h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 30px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-top: 8px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}
.contact-form > p {
  margin-top: 16px;
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
}

.field-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
  margin-top: 28px;
}
.field-grid .field--full { grid-column: span 2; }

.field {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
}

.field label {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
}
.field label .required-dot {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  background: var(--sage);
  border-radius: 50%;
  margin-left: 6px;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
.field label .field-hint {
  display: block;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 13px;
  text-transform: none;
  letter-spacing: normal;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 4px;
}

.field input,
.field select,
.field textarea {
  width: 100%;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
  border: 1px solid var(--mist);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 12px 14px;
  background: var(--white);
  transition: border-color 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
}
.field textarea { min-height: 120px; resize: vertical; }
.field select { appearance: none; background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='%236B7A8F' stroke-width='2'><polyline points='6 9 12 15 18 9'/></svg>"); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: right 14px center; background-size: 16px; padding-right: 40px; }

.field input::placeholder,
.field textarea::placeholder { color: var(--stone); opacity: 0.6; }

.field input:focus,
.field select:focus,
.field textarea:focus {
  outline: none;
  border-color: var(--sage);
  border-width: 2px;
  padding: 11px 13px;
}
.field textarea:focus { padding: 11px 13px; }

.contact-form .btn-primary {
  width: 100%;
  margin-top: 24px;
  height: 52px;
  border-radius: 8px;
}

/* Reassurance card */
.reassure-card {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);
}

.reassure-card__intro {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.reassure-card__intro svg {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  color: var(--sage);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  margin-top: 4px;
}
.reassure-card__intro p {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.trust-list {
  margin-top: 20px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}
.trust-list li {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.5;
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.trust-list svg {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  color: var(--sage);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.callback-line {
  margin-top: 20px;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
}
.callback-line .number { color: var(--sage); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .contact-form-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .field-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .field-grid .field--full { grid-column: auto; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Map block
   ========================================================================== */
.map-section { background: var(--mist); }

.map-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 55% 45%;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.map-tile {
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(26,35,50,0.08);
  border: 1px solid var(--mist);
  background: var(--white);
  aspect-ratio: 4/3;
}
.map-tile svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }

.map-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
.map-info .body-copy {
  margin-top: 20px;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.map-info .body-copy strong { font-weight: 600; }

.map-info-list {
  margin-top: 24px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}
.map-info-list li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.map-info-list svg {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  color: var(--sage);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .map-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Contact channels (feature_grid)
   ========================================================================== */
.contact-channels { background: var(--white); padding: 72px 0; }

.contact-channels__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 32px;
}

.channel-card {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 28px 24px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  transition: background-color 200ms ease;
}
.channel-card:hover { background: #C7E7DD; }

.channel-card__icon {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  color: var(--sage);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.channel-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 16px;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.channel-card p {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
}
.channel-card .accent { color: var(--sage); font-weight: 600; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .contact-channels__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .contact-channels__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Contact FAQ split
   ========================================================================== */
.contact-faq { background: var(--cloud); }

.contact-faq__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 55% 45%;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: start;
}

.contact-faq__list { order: 1; }
.contact-faq__sidebar { order: 2; }

.contact-faq__sidebar h2 {
  margin-top: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 28px;
  color: var(--slate);
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.contact-illo-tile {
  background: var(--mist);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 24px;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 320px;
  margin: 28px 0 24px;
  aspect-ratio: 4/3;
}
.contact-illo-tile svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

.contact-faq__footer-line {
  margin-top: 40px;
  text-align: center;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
}
.contact-faq__footer-line .number { color: var(--sage); font-style: normal; }

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .contact-faq__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .contact-faq__sidebar { order: 1; }
  .contact-faq__list { order: 2; }
}

/* ==========================================================================
   Helpers
   ========================================================================== */
.text-left { text-align: left; }
.text-center { text-align: center; }
.mt-32 { margin-top: 32px; }
.mt-40 { margin-top: 40px; }

.center-cta {
  margin-top: 40px;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
}

